{"id":38,"date":"2011-09-19T18:22:15","date_gmt":"2011-09-19T23:22:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=38"},"modified":"2011-09-19T18:22:15","modified_gmt":"2011-09-19T23:22:15","slug":"poor-quincy","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2011\/09\/19\/poor-quincy\/","title":{"rendered":"Poor Quincy"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Well, we think maybe our dear Walker Tree Hound, Quincy, &#8230;. may have had a stroke yesterday afternoon. \u00a0He seems to have very little control when he&#8217;s walking &#8230; as if he&#8217;s drunk.<\/p>\n<p>He&#8217;s had a hard life (up until when we adopted him last year), based on how he acts, we believe he&#8217;s spent most of his life outside tied to a tree or doghouse. \u00a0He&#8217;s mostly deaf, blind in one eye, and to make matters worse, we had him neutered when we adopted him from the Humane Society &#8212; Poor Boy ..<\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s sad to watch him, he knows there&#8217;s a problem and he just can&#8217;t seem to figure things out, he&#8217;s stopped eating and that&#8217;s not good. \u00a0Our veterinarian is closed on Monday but Kathy will call tomorrow to see what we should do, if anything.<\/p>\n<p>Keep us in your prayers, we might be in for a rough ride.<\/p>\n<p><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:#eeeeee;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-39 alignright\" title=\"Super Dog Quincy\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707.jpg?w=1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"283\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707-768x433.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/2011-06-04_20-55-13_707-1024x577.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 502px) 100vw, 502px\" \/><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"mceTemp\">\n<dl class=\"wp-caption alignright\">\n<dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\">Quincy&#8217;s got it made now<\/dd>\n<\/dl>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Well, we think maybe our dear Walker Tree Hound, Quincy, &#8230;. may have had a stroke yesterday afternoon. \u00a0He seems to have very little control when he&#8217;s walking &#8230; as if he&#8217;s drunk. He&#8217;s had a hard life (up until when we adopted him last year), based on how he acts, we believe he&#8217;s spent &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2011\/09\/19\/poor-quincy\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Poor Quincy<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406],"tags":[219927],"class_list":["post-38","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-family","tag-quincy"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/38","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=38"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/38\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":41,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/38\/revisions\/41"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=38"}],"wp:term":[{"taxono